{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_13522","headline":"杂诗 · 王季友","name":"杂诗","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"采山仍采隐，在山不在深。\n持斧事远游，固非匠者心。\n翳翳青桐枝，樵爨日所侵。\n斧声出岩壑，四听无知音。\n岂爲鼎下薪，当复堂上琴。\n凤鸟久不栖，且与枳棘林。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"王季友","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_13522.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_13522","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}